      "created_at": "2021-09-30T13:19:04.334Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you want to try some out, I would suggest subscribing to a mature mod like the Cauldron, and play games with all regular Sentinels content except one thing (a hero or environment, initially). That is a good way to get a sense of things without getting overwhelmed.</p>",
